data: {"id": "d4de4be5d49b446f-thinking-parallel_evidence-907", "run_id": "d4de4be5d49b446f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n- **Pod 当前状态**：`aiops-case-v12/workload` 仍然存在，`phase: Running`，`deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-14T05:51:48Z`，`terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 3900`（65 分钟），`finalizers: <none>`，`nodeName: node2`，容器 `ready=True`，`restarts=0`。\n- **事件**：仅有一条 `Normal Killing` 事件（`Stopping container app`），无 `FailedKillPod`、`VolumeMount` 错误或 Node 异常事件。\n- **节点状态**：`node2` 为 `Ready`，无 NotReady/Unknown 迹象。\n- **重启指标**：PromQL 60 分钟范围内 `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 始终为 0，无重启。\n- **日志**：30 分钟内仅 1 条 `applicatio", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789361276941, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

